  "description": "To pay back the 10 billion won her father stole and disappeared with, Yeseo becomes collateral for a terrifying man, Do Kang-hyun. Knowing that this cruel man, who only knows how to possess, could never return her love, she barely manages to hold onto her heart and denies her growing feelings. However, faced with Kang-hyun’s barbaric and wild obsession, Yeseo eventually admits it. Even if that choice means falling together into the abyss led by Do Kang-hyun.\nSource: MU",
